{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465930/extras/SteamQuickCut.gif?t=1743778329\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play</strong> video pinball, <strong>relax</strong> in vaporwave environments and enjoy an <strong>anti-stress digital holiday</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 unlockable tables.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 layers per table.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">unlock everything in a few hours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play endless to beat your own high score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bespoke Vaporwave soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Less for pinball simulation fans and more for chill, flow state pinball fans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465930/extras/MoreBelow.gif?t=1743778329\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Discover new layers</strong> on each table and dive deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465930/extras/GIF_Clip07.gif?t=1743778329\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bounce your way to beat your own high score or <strong>simply chill in a liminal dream</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465930/extras/GIF_Clip08.gif?t=1743778329\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Designed to play for <strong>a few minutes</strong>\u00a0or <strong>a</strong> <strong>few hours</strong>, at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465930/extras/GIF_Clip05.gif?t=1743778329\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stimulation </strong>not simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465930/extras/GIF_Clip06.gif?t=1743778329\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Things you can <strong>only do in video pinball.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465930/extras/GIF_Clip04.gif?t=1743778329\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sometimes things <strong>get a bit weird.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465930/extras/GIF_Clip02.gif?t=1743778329\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But <strong>always fun.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465930/extras/GIF_Clip03.gif?t=1743778329\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featuring an <strong>original</strong>\u00a0<strong>Vaporwave Soundtrack. </strong><br><br><br><strong></strong> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2465930?t=1743778329","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465930/76d6201a5d09632267fbeee77b75524225896efa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743778329","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_